---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About the endoretic archive and the work kept in it."
>
  <div class="shell page-shell page-shell--narrow">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / About</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        endoretic is a personal archive. It keeps the tools I build, the notes I
        write, and the things that are still unfinished.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of the work here falls into two groups. One is research tooling
        around <a href="/works/zotero-wallpaper/">Zotero</a>, including a local
        wallpaper plugin and <a href="/works/zontex/">Zontex</a>, a library
        workflow driven through Codex. The other is a set of small tools for
        Project SEKAI: an event-point planner, a song tier-list maker, a chart
        converter, and a package repacker. Nearly all of it is open source and
        runs locally or as a static page.
      </p>
      <p>
        The full list, with sources and licences, is under
        <a href="/works/">Works</a>. Third-party media used on this site is
        credited on the <a href="/credits/">Credits</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/endoretic">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="pending-note">
        [TODO: owner-supplied biography, interests, and contact details]
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
